        "execSummary":  "Gemini 3.8 Live represents a significant leap for AI-powered voice agents in enterprise customer support—real-time reasoning during conversation, multilingual support across 97 languages, and native agentic task execution without pausing dialogue. The Extended Thinking variant is the most relevant for complex support scenarios where an agent must reason through a problem while keeping the customer engaged. Integration with LangChain, LiveKit, and Workspace lowers the barrier to deployment on existing enterprise stacks. The key question is latency and accuracy at scale—benchmark rankings are vendor-reported and independent evaluation is warranted before production deployment.",
