        "theme":  "Strategy",
        "summary":  "The article presents an evolved framework of seven leadership capabilities—Coherence, Communication, Currency, Confidence, Conviction, Courage, and Change—that IT leaders must develop to succeed in the AI era. These competencies operate within an environment of \u0027Compression,\u0027 where technology cycles accelerate, forming a compounding flywheel that strengthens with each cycle of learning and adaptation.",
